-- Transitions. Eval one line at a time; the commented ones are cues.

-- Fade a new pattern into orbit 4 over 8 cycles (crossfade).
-- xfadeIn 4 8 $ air

-- Fade orbit 6 out by crossfading to silence.
-- xfadeIn 6 8 $ silence

-- Fade several orbits out over 8 cycles (shared helper).
-- fadeSilence 8 [4,6]

-- Noise riser: hold for ~4 cycles, then silence it.
-- d9 $ riser

-- Stop just the riser.
-- d9 $ silence

-- Emergency: stop every orbit immediately.
-- hush

-- Restart cleanly after a mistake.
-- hush
-- setbpm 72
